---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout title="stenbom.me" description="About Robert Stenbom.">
	<h1>Robert Stenbom</h1>
	<p>
		Hi, I'm Robert — a software engineer. This is my personal site, mostly a technical
		blog where I write up things I've learned, built, or broken.
	</p>
	<p>
		I'm interested in developer tooling, infrastructure, and building things that are
		easy to reason about. Outside of that I tinker with my own dev environment
		(<a href="https://github.com/TransitoryBliss/dev-env">dev-env</a>) more than is
		strictly necessary.
	</p>
	<p>
		You can find my code on <a href="https://github.com/TransitoryBliss">GitHub</a>, or
		read the <a href="/blog/">blog</a>.
	</p>
</BaseLayout>
